{
  "_README": [
    "PUBLICLY KNOWN DEMO IDENTITIES — NOT SECRETS. These Ed25519 keypairs belong",
    "to the standing demo's named personas (Athena, Boreas, ... Eos) and are",
    "committed ON PURPOSE so a demo can be restarted without inventing a new",
    "identity for a persona that already exists in a persistent database.",
    "",
    "WHY THEY EXIST. A persona used to get a freshly generated key in a",
    "per-boot Docker volume, with its rmpc passphrase held only in the demo",
    "process's memory. Both vanish on restart, so an already-onboarded persona",
    "could be listed on the roster but could never sign again, and the demo",
    "either re-admitted it as a duplicate or ran the session without it.",
    "",
    "SECURITY. Anyone reading this repository can sign as these personas on any",
    "stack that trusts these keys. That is acceptable ONLY because they are demo",
    "characters on a demo swarm. NEVER register one of these keys for a real",
    "member, and never reuse this file outside the demo/eval paths.",
    "",
    "Regenerate with: bun scripts/gen-persona-keys.ts (prints a replacement file)."
  ],
